  "acceptance": [
    "Spark adapters pick toArrow, Arrow-enabled toPandas, or collect() by runtime version; unit tests with stubbed DataFrames cover each of the three paths and the version switch, and live pyspark 3.5 and 4.x runs are recorded where those environments exist (a missing environment is named, not skipped silently).",
    "Digests match the collect() path.",
    "Snowpark Connect outcome recorded."
